  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introdução ao Loupe</title>

    <para>
      <application>Loupe</application> is an application used for viewing image
files on the <application>GNOME</application> Desktop.
    </para>

    &lfs124_checked;

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Informação do Pacote</bridgehead>
    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
